{"4760740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Verum Titan", "steam_appid": 4760740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4777420], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VERUM TITAN is a single-player, narrative-driven first-person shooter with fast, old-school combat and an immersive story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a silent room with no memory of who you are or how you got here. The only name you have is your own: Carla. Outside lies a monument to a vanished humanity, gleaming cities, empty plazas, abandoned trains, now patrolled by machines that open fire on anything that moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/4349a0008e9e2d4e7f02f81434550a12.poster.avif?t=1787914117\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/4349a0008e9e2d4e7f02f81434550a12.webm?t=1787914117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/4349a0008e9e2d4e7f02f81434550a12.mp4?t=1787914117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find out what happened to everyone, you'll have to fight your way through it. But you're not entirely alone. Romer  a small, well-meaning vacuum-cleaner robot  decides to tag along, and somewhere between the gunfights and the wreckage, the two of you become friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/04b3beced89c4c6cae429785b2f6663e.poster.avif?t=1787914117\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/04b3beced89c4c6cae429785b2f6663e.webm?t=1787914117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/04b3beced89c4c6cae429785b2f6663e.mp4?t=1787914117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-school shooting.</strong> Pick up weapons like rifles, shotguns or the black-hole gun, shields and grenades to tear through a variety of enemies across tightly designed levels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world worth exploring.</strong> Distinct, hand-crafted locations, from a mountain facility, city, train station, Corporation HQ, museum, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for the truth.</strong> Find hidden Dataobelisks and trade them to PACH, the Databroker, for the lore and secrets behind humanity's fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voice-acted.</strong> Carla, Romer, and all other characters are all brought to life by voice actors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/88f0bd938152c5ef64e75279320b9b7f.poster.avif?t=1787914117\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/88f0bd938152c5ef64e75279320b9b7f.webm?t=1787914117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/88f0bd938152c5ef64e75279320b9b7f.mp4?t=1787914117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VERUM TITAN is a single-player, narrative-driven first-person shooter with fast, old-school combat and an immersive story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a silent room with no memory of who you are or how you got here. The only name you have is your own: Carla. Outside lies a monument to a vanished humanity, gleaming cities, empty plazas, abandoned trains, now patrolled by machines that open fire on anything that moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/4349a0008e9e2d4e7f02f81434550a12.poster.avif?t=1787914117\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/4349a0008e9e2d4e7f02f81434550a12.webm?t=1787914117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/4349a0008e9e2d4e7f02f81434550a12.mp4?t=1787914117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find out what happened to everyone, you'll have to fight your way through it. But you're not entirely alone. Romer  a small, well-meaning vacuum-cleaner robot  decides to tag along, and somewhere between the gunfights and the wreckage, the two of you become friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/04b3beced89c4c6cae429785b2f6663e.poster.avif?t=1787914117\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/04b3beced89c4c6cae429785b2f6663e.webm?t=1787914117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/04b3beced89c4c6cae429785b2f6663e.mp4?t=1787914117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-school shooting.</strong> Pick up weapons like rifles, shotguns or the black-hole gun, shields and grenades to tear through a variety of enemies across tightly designed levels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world worth exploring.</strong> Distinct, hand-crafted locations, from a mountain facility, city, train station, Corporation HQ, museum, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for the truth.</strong> Find hidden Dataobelisks and trade them to PACH, the Databroker, for the lore and secrets behind humanity's fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voice-acted.</strong> Carla, Romer, and all other characters are all brought to life by voice actors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/88f0bd938152c5ef64e75279320b9b7f.poster.avif?t=1787914117\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/88f0bd938152c5ef64e75279320b9b7f.webm?t=1787914117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760740/extras/88f0bd938152c5ef64e75279320b9b7f.mp4?t=1787914117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A first-person narrative driven action game. You wake up as Carla, no memories, lost in a futuristic world. On your journey you must blast through an army of enemies. Accompanied by Romer, your Vacuum cleaner sidekick you will travel to unlock the mysteries of what happened.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Dutch, Polish,